#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "68_Sodachi"
msgid "Thanks to our four apprentices, we've been getting new students and the dojo has been thriving!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "80_Saejima"
msgid "You're right. Guess you won't be needin' me much anymore."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "92_Sodachi"
msgid "Whaaaat!? What are you saying!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "104_Sodachi"
msgid "If you leave, things will just go back to the way they were!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "116_Sodachi"
msgid "Plus... The dojo won't be the same without you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "128_Sodachi"
msgid "If possible, I want you to stay here forever."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "140_Saejima"
msgid "Thanks, but I can't stick around forever. I got my own life too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "152_Saejima"
msgid "You gotta start thinkin' about how to run things without me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Sodachi"
msgid "But I'll be in a world of trouble if you up and leave now. Could you just stay for a little longer? Please?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "176_Sodachi"
msgid "That will give me enough time to think about the future of things."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Saejima"
msgid "All right, all right."
msgstr "De acuerdo, de acuerdo."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Saejima"
msgid "How's about I stick around to train just one more student? That'll be my last apprentice."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "212_Sodachi"
msgid "All right. Just one more... I wonder who that will be..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Tokita"
msgid "Aaaagh!"
msgstr "¡Aaaagh!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Saejima"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "¿Mm?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "284_Student"
msgid "Sorry! Did I hurt you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_Tokita"
msgid "Who do you think you are? I'm a champion, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "308_Tokita"
msgid "What were you gonna do if I got injured? Huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Student"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Lo siento..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "332_Tokita"
msgid "You should take it as an honor that I let you help me with my training!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "344_Tokita"
msgid "But you just throw me around like you're not thinking about anything at all! Unbelievable!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "356_Student"
msgid "Sorry! I didn't think that I could throw you that easily to be honest..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "368_Tokita"
msgid "You! Are you trying to start a fight!? I'm not going to let you get away with this, fat-ass!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "380_Student"
msgid "Nnngh..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "392_Saejima"
msgid "Who's that?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "404_Sodachi"
msgid "That's Tokita."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "416_Saejima"
msgid "Not him, ya idiot. The guy next to 'im, gettin' chewed out."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "428_Sodachi"
msgid "Oh, that's Masataka Watanabe-kun. A new student that just joined."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "440_Sodachi"
msgid "He has a good build, and some pretty good skills to match."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Sodachi"
msgid "But... He's just too good of a person. He's afraid to hurt others, and so he can't make use of his skills in a fight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "464_Sodachi"
msgid "Apparently, he joined the dojo because he wanted to change that aspect of himself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "476_Sodachi"
msgid "But I guess it's not so easy to change..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "488_Sodachi"
msgid "I'm having trouble figuring out how to train him properly."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "500_Saejima"
msgid "Too kind, huh? Heheh. Sounds interestin'."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "584_Watanabe"
msgid "Are you absolutely sure that you want <Italic>me</Italic> to be your last apprentice?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "596_Watanabe"
msgid "There are loads of people that have been waiting to be taught by you, Saejima-san..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "608_Sodachi"
msgid "No worries! Saejima-san has made up his mind and it was his own decision."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "620_Watanabe"
msgid "Thank you so much. But now I just feel bad for everyone else..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "632_Saejima"
msgid "Fine. Then why don't ya just quit? Course that'd mean you ain't never gonna change."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "644_Watanabe"
msgid "Never... change..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "656_Saejima"
msgid "Is that what ya want?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "668_Watanabe"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "¡No!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "680_Watanabe"
msgid "Saejima-san, help me become a strong man! I don't want to be Mr. Nice Guy anymore!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "692_Watanabe"
msgid "Please... Saejima-san!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "704_Sodachi"
msgid "Wow! I've never seen Watanabe this enthusiastic before!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "716_Sodachi"
msgid "This is good! I think he's worthy to be your last apprentice!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "728_Saejima"
msgid "Heh... All right. Try n' keep up with me, like yer life depends on it. I'll make you stronger. I give ya my word."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "740_Watanabe"
msgid "Yes, sir! Saejima-sensei!"
msgstr ""
